# Notebook Rules

## Role of notebooks

Notebooks are research and reproducibility artifacts.

They should demonstrate:

- dataset understanding;
- experiment design;
- model comparison;
- evaluation;
- conclusions.

They are not production application modules.

The API, inference service, and Docker runtime must not depend on notebooks.

## Target notebook set

When consolidation is requested, aim for an authoritative structure such as:

```text
notebooks/
├── 01_exploration.ipynb
├── 02_classical_ml.ipynb
└── 03_transformer.ipynb
